    "detailed_description": "<strong> Grab it, turn it, hit it, and complete the manga! ! </strong><br>\t\t\t\t<br>In &quot;Comic Bachicon!!&quot;, a player who has become a very popular manga artist is trying to complete his manuscript.<br>Characters that jumped out from the world of manga are thrown into frames.<br>It's an action game where you complete a manuscript! !<br>Hit the characters everywhere, including the pieces and the ground! !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Exhilarating hitting action! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762490/extras/055633aa57ecd70c8907e3d04af67970.poster.avif?t=1711715044\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762490/extras/055633aa57ecd70c8907e3d04af67970.webm?t=1711715044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762490/extras/055633aa57ecd70c8907e3d04af67970.mp4?t=1711715044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Grab it, turn it, and hit it! !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Hit all the pieces in the stage and aim for completion! </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762490/extras/f717fa85eb15e291dbcf77f2bcd65e27.poster.avif?t=1711715044\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762490/extras/f717fa85eb15e291dbcf77f2bcd65e27.webm?t=1711715044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762490/extras/f717fa85eb15e291dbcf77f2bcd65e27.mp4?t=1711715044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Comic Bachicon!!&quot; is a manga artist's rampage that is an exhilarating puzzle action game!<br>You can compete with other manga artists (users) in the ranking for the high score of the stage!<br>Aim for the highest circulation number - high score - and complete your manga!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>Very popular manga artist (planned) new manga artist Kotori Saotome!<br>Become \u201cOtome Tori Kotori\u201d in her mind and complete the manga!<br>A story about how to meet the deadline and become a popular manga artist!<br><br><strong> Can you complete the manga by the deadline? ! </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character introduction</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762490/extras/017bfdf0ca82d751735afce121f9c0d7.avif?t=1711715044\" width=350 height=131 /></span><br><strong>Kotori Saotome (right)</strong>:<br>Kotori Saotome, 22 years old, is drawing manga while attending university!<br>She has an otaku and quiet personality, and the active ``maiden bird Kotori'' in her brain helps her create her manga.<br>Complete the manga in her mind and aim for a blockbuster series!!<br>\t\t\t\t<br><strong>Maiden Tori Kotori (left)</strong>:<br>Kotori Kotori is helping \u201cKotori Saotome\u201d create manga in her mind!<br>Grab the manga characters scattered in your brain, spin them, and smash them into frames!<br>She is active and completes the manga with her exhilarating movements!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6About secondary use</h2>Please refrain from publishing creative works that fall under the following provisions.<br>Content intended to harm this work or the idea or honor of a third party.<br>Violent, grotesque, or containing sexual depictions<br>Contents that excessively support or disparage specific politics, religions, or beliefs<br>anti-social expressions<br>Items that infringe on the rights of third parties<br>These guidelines are subject to change.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System requirements</h2>minimum requirements<br>OS*: Windows 10<br>Processor: Intel Core i5-3470 | AMD FX-8350<br>Memory: 8GB